{"unit_id":"tag:08LZ:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是位点（site）。一个严格的全子范畴（full subcategory）<MATH_0002> 称为 <TEXTITOPEN_0001>闭子拓扑斯（closed subtopos）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，若存在子层（subsheaf）<MATH_0003>，它是 <MATH_0004> 的终对象（final object）的子层，使得 <MATH_0005> 是引理 <REF_0001> 中描述的子拓扑斯（subtopos）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"全子范畴"},{"source_term":"closed subtopos","target_term":"闭子拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"subsheaf","target_term":"子层"},{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象"},{"source_term":"subtopos","target_term":"子拓扑斯"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"全子范畴","context":"strictly full subcategory；待决。"},{"source_term":"closed subtopos","target_term":"闭子拓扑斯","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"subsheaf","target_term":"子层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"subtopos","target_term":"子拓扑斯","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08LT:prose-0005","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n好了，现在可以定义拓扑斯（topoi）的闭浸入（closed immersion）和开浸入（open immersion）的含义。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08M0:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是拓扑斯态射（morphism of topoi）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 称 <MATH_0002> 为 <TEXTITOPEN_0001>开浸入（open immersion）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，若 <MATH_0003> 是嵌入（embedding），且 <MATH_0004> 的本质像（image）是开子拓扑斯（open subtopos）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 称 <MATH_0005> 为 <TEXTITOPEN_0002>闭浸入（closed immersion）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，若 <MATH_0006> 是嵌入（embedding），且 <MATH_0007> 的本质像（image）是闭子拓扑斯（closed subtopos）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入"},{"source_term":"embedding","target_term":"嵌入"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"本质像"},{"source_term":"open subtopos","target_term":"开子拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"embedding","target_term":"嵌入"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"本质像"},{"source_term":"closed subtopos","target_term":"闭子拓扑斯"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"open immersion","target_term":"开浸入","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"embedding","target_term":"嵌入","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"本质像","context":"essential image；待决。"},{"source_term":"open subtopos","target_term":"开子拓扑斯","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"closed subtopos","target_term":"闭子拓扑斯","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08M1:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是拓扑斯（topoi）的闭浸入（closed immersion）。则 <MATH_0002> 全忠实（fully faithful），将满射（surjections）变为满射（surjections），与余等化子（coequalizers）可交换（commutes），与推出（pushouts）可交换（commutes），反映单射（injections）、满射（surjections）和双射（bijections）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实"},{"source_term":"surjections","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"surjections","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"coequalizers","target_term":"余等化子"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"可交换"},{"source_term":"pushouts","target_term":"推出"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"可交换"},{"source_term":"injections","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"surjections","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"bijections","target_term":"双射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"closed immersion","target_term":"闭浸入","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"fully faithful","target_term":"全忠实","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"surjections","target_term":"满射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"coequalizers","target_term":"余等化子","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"可交换","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"pushouts","target_term":"推出","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"injections","target_term":"单射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"bijections","target_term":"双射","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08M1:proof","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是终对象（final object）<MATH_0002>（属于 <MATH_0003>）的子层（subsheaf），并设 <MATH_0004> 是由那些 <MATH_0005> 组成的全子范畴（full subcategory），其中 <MATH_0006> 是同构（isomorphism）。由引理 <REF_0001>，函子（functor）<MATH_0007> 同构（isomorphic）于包含函子（inclusion functor）<MATH_0008>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n设 <MATH_0009> 是局部化（localization）函子（functor）（引理 <REF_0002>）。注意 <MATH_0010> 也可描述为满足 <MATH_0012> 的层（sheaves）<MATH_0011> 的集合。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n设 <MATH_0013> 是 <MATH_0014> 的两个态射（morphism）。为证明 <MATH_0015> 与余等化子（coequalizers）可交换（commutes），只须证明 <MATH_0016>、<MATH_0017> 在 <MATH_0018> 中的余等化子（coequalizer）属于 <MATH_0019>。这是显然的，因为两个态射（morphisms）<MATH_0020> 的余等化子（coequalizer）是 <MATH_0021>，且 <MATH_0022> 正合（exact）。推出（pushouts）的情形类似。\n\n<STRUCT_0005><STRUCT_0006>\n因此 <MATH_0023> 满足引理 <REF_0003> 的性质 (5)、(6)、(7)，从而态射（morphism）<MATH_0024> 满足该引理中提及的所有性质，特别是本引理提及的性质。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象"},{"source_term":"subsheaf","target_term":"子层"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"全子范畴"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"inclusion functor","target_term":"包含函子"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"coequalizers","target_term":"余等化子"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"可交换"},{"source_term":"coequalizer","target_term":"余等化子"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"coequalizer","target_term":"余等化子"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"pushouts","target_term":"推出"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"subsheaf","target_term":"子层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"全子范畴","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"inclusion functor","target_term":"包含函子","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"localization","target_term":"局部化","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"保留源文 two morphism 的单数形式；待决。"},{"source_term":"coequalizers","target_term":"余等化子","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"可交换","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"coequalizer","target_term":"余等化子","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"pushouts","target_term":"推出","context":"待决。"}],"notes":["源文 two morphism 使用单数；中文按两个态射表达，不修改英文来源。"]}
