{"unit_id":"tag:00YS:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是位点（sites）的态射（morphism），由函子（functor）<MATH_0002> 给出。对于代数结构（algebraic structures）的预层（presheaves），按规则 <MATH_0003> 定义 <TEXTITOPEN_0001>正像（pushforward）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001> 函子（functor）；对于代数结构（algebraic structures）的层（sheaves），也按同一规则，即 <MATH_0004> 定义。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"algebraic structures","target_term":"代数结构"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"pushforward","target_term":"正像"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"algebraic structures","target_term":"代数结构"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic structures","target_term":"代数结构","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"pushforward","target_term":"正像","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00YR:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n问题出在尝试定义逆像（pullback）时。原因是第 <REF_0001> 节中定义函子（functor）<MATH_0001> 的余极限（colimits）可能不是滤过的（filtered）。因此，上述公理一般不足以定义代数结构（algebraic structures）的（预）层（sheaf）的逆像（pullback）。尽管如此，在几乎所有情形中，下面的引理都足以定义代数结构（algebraic structures）的（预）层（sheaves）的正像（pushforward）和逆像（pullback）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"逆像"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限"},{"source_term":"filtered","target_term":"滤过的"},{"source_term":"algebraic structures","target_term":"代数结构"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"逆像"},{"source_term":"algebraic structures","target_term":"代数结构"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"pushforward","target_term":"正像"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"逆像"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"逆像","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"colimits","target_term":"余极限","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"filtered","target_term":"滤过的","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic structures","target_term":"代数结构","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"(pre)sheaf；待决。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"(pre)sheaves；待决。"},{"source_term":"pushforward","target_term":"正像","context":"待决。"}],"notes":["源文 trying the define 有语法笔误；按尝试定义的语义翻译，英文来源未改。"]}
